anies across the world.</div><div class="spacer-small"><div class="static-logo-grid"><div class="logo-item"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6a168a6476dae3dc705e7c8f_67a46ee2ef2d08472de21595_Frame%201597881756%201.avif" alt="" class="logo_img is-small"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/69b30d93ef7e281838ffc132_Path%206210.svg" alt="" class="logo-item-icon-info"/><div class="logo-item-popover"><p class="logo-item-quote">AppSecure’s continuous testing gave us clear visibility into security gaps across every release, helping our teams address risks before they reached production.</p><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="divider-gray"></div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="testimonial_client-info"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6a1d0379d891929be3b2e265_69b38bda9446d724f94a2de0_Mridul%20Gupta%20Zolve%201.avif" alt="Ankit Solanki" class="testimonial_client-img"/><div class="testimonial_client-details"><div class="testimonial_client-name">Mridul Gupta</div><div class="logo-itemclient-designation">Engineering Lead, Zolve</div></div></div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="divider-gray"></div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><a href="/case-study/zolve" target="_blank" class="button1 is-text w-inline-block"><div>Read Case Study</div><div class="icon-1x1-medium w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"/></svg></div></a></div></div><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6a168a833896c4008c6a063d_678a6fc2dfc262c4f1a973c7_Zamp%201.avif" alt="" class="logo_img"/><div class="logo-item"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6a168adca492840fe7ef7743_678a6fc2a52881c3715b1b58_Skyflow%201.avif" alt="" class="logo_img"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/69b30d93ef7e281838ffc132_Path%206210.svg" alt="" class="logo-item-icon-info"/><div class="logo-item-popover"><p class="logo-item-quote">I have been impressed with AppSecure team&#x27;s deep expertise on the OWASP areas, and the team does quite a thorough job on each of the engagements and provide detailed and timely reports.</p><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="divider-gray"></div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="testimonial_client-info"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6792a31a424c81e5eeae4858_image%20(11).webp" alt="Daniel Wong" class="testimonial_client-img"/><div class="testimonial_client-details"><div class="testimonial_client-name">Daniel Wong</div><div class="logo-itemclient-designation">CISO, Skyflow</div></div></div></div></div><img sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6a168aff75f16d930c81f630_69b24a58c6e73a22459afa39_envoy%20global%20%201-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6a168aff75f16d930c81f630_69b24a58c6e73a22459afa39_envoy%20global%20%201-p-800.avif 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6a168aff75f16d930c81f630_69b24a58c6e73a22459afa39_envoy%20global%20%201.avif 918w" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6a168aff75f16d930c81f630_69b24a58c6e73a22459afa39_envoy%20global%20%201.avif" loading="lazy" class="logo_img"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6a168b17124d55cb3b45aa08_69b248199b95808e80681516_Blackhawk%20Network%201.avif" alt="" class="logo_img"/><div class="logo-item"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6a168b4712e768c86f0c5b6b_69b248732844fb0f1f65bf15_SignEasy%20(1)%201.avif" alt="" class="logo_img"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/69b30d93ef7e281838ffc132_Path%206210.svg" alt="" class="logo-item-icon-info"/><div class="logo-item-popover"><p class="logo-item-quote">Appsecure pointed out a bunch of high and critical vulnerabilities, helping us meet our goals and making our applications and APIs more secure.</p><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="divider-gray"></div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="testimonial_client-info"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6792a31b3c9b59feb4764188_image%20(12).webp" alt="Souvik Dutta" class="testimonial_client-img"/><div class="testimonial_client-details"><div class="testimonial_client-name">Souvik Dutta</div><div class="logo-itemclient-designation">CTO &amp; Country Head, SignEasy</div></div></div></div></div><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/67a46ee10a84035297e77ad7_Frame%201597881752.webp" alt="" class="logo_img"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6a168b6c95a315d4ca92fdc5_69b3deba383f154e7c58efd4_ema-logo.267c015f%201.avif" alt="" class="logo_img custom-logo-size-6"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6a168b860effbb609233f8de_69b249a40bdb4b6b4f5b6cb6_Kudelski%20nagra%201.avif" alt="" class="logo_img"/><img sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6a168bc2124d55cb3b45eb60_678a6fc3f5cb3ea2b28d4973_Skidata%201-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6a168bc2124d55cb3b45eb60_678a6fc3f5cb3ea2b28d4973_Skidata%201.avif 602w" alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6a168bc2124d55cb3b45eb60_678a6fc3f5cb3ea2b28d4973_Skidata%201.avif" loading="lazy" class="logo_img"/><div class="logo-item"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6a168bd3f3113b05b238f714_6901f261c7dfc8c216432b85_68c7ba52afa82f97b0cf6a5e_Green-Horizontal-Logo-Matillion_%201.avif" alt="" class="logo_img custom-logo-size-2"/><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/69b30d93ef7e281838ffc132_Path%206210.svg" alt="" class="logo-item-icon-info"/><div class="logo-item-popover cc-popover-left-shift"><p class="logo-item-quote">AppSecure sharpened our security posture by identifying real, exploitable vulnerabilities, enabling us to prioritize what truly matters.</p><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="divider-gray"></div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="testimonial_client-info"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6a1d03e5b939ef8e36da4cf0_69b30591d3213a1f5a0470aa_mridul%20gupta%201.avif" alt="Souvik Dutta" class="testimonial_client-img"/><div class="testimonial_client-details"><div class="testimonial_client-name">Suchit Mishra</div><div class="logo-itemclient-designation">Director of Information Security, Matillion</div></div></div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="divider-gray"></div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><a href="/case-study/matillion" target="_blank" class="button1 is-text w-inline-block"><div>Read Case Study</div><div class="icon-1x1-medium w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"/></svg></div></a></div></div><div class="w-embed"><style>

