343-13.18 4.3-6.018 1.394-12.601 2.093-19.776 2.093-7.86 0-14.075-1.922-18.627-5.767-4.559-3.852-6.977-9.165-7.255-15.931h72.948v-18.594c0-17.887-4.85-31.59-14.552-41.094" fill="currentColor"/></svg></div><div class="tab_timer"></div><div class="tab_timer is-active"></div></a></div><div class="tab_content-wrapper w-tab-content"><div data-w-tab="Tab 1" class="w-tab-pane w--tab-active"><div class="tab_content"><div class="tab_content-left"><div class="tab_content-left-top"><div class="tab_content-title">Plivo Detects and Blocks Evolving Threats with AppSecure. 1</div><p class="tab_content-paragraph">AppSecure is like our extended security team. The AppSecure team is very patient in pointing out the non-trivial security bugs in our systems.</p></div><a href="#" class="button1 is-fifth w-inline-block"><div>Read Customer Story</div><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678141cce3153cc1bfc4e887_Arrow%20Right%20Up.webp" alt="" class="icon-1x1-medium"/></a></div><div id="w-node-_1e5f78fd-268f-e061-9041-c4d4387f0886-baefee19" class="tab_content-right"><img sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678142b8adaf283996ad2a47_2b10dd0c25b088e96514fe30ea7ce83c-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678142b8adaf283996ad2a47_2b10dd0c25b088e96514fe30ea7ce83c-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678142b8adaf283996ad2a47_2b10dd0c25b088e96514fe30ea7ce83c-p-1080.webp 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678142b8adaf283996ad2a47_2b10dd0c25b088e96514fe30ea7ce83c.webp 1801w" alt="A computer screen with a bunch of data on it." src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678142b8adaf283996ad2a47_2b10dd0c25b088e96514fe30ea7ce83c.webp" loading="lazy" class="tab_content-img"/><div class="tab_content-overlay"><img sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6793366d7bce8aad84c6751b_1000028201-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6793366d7bce8aad84c6751b_1000028201.webp 960w" alt="Appsecure security team - hardik" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6793366d7bce8aad84c6751b_1000028201.webp" loading="lazy" class="tab_content_overlay-img"/></div></div></div></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 2" class="w-tab-pane"><div class="tab_content"><div class="tab_content-left"><div class="tab_content-left-top"><div class="tab_content-title">Plivo Detects and Blocks Evolving Threats with AppSecure. 2</div><p class="tab_content-paragraph">AppSecure is like our extended security team. The AppSecure team is very patient in pointing out the non-trivial security bugs in our systems.</p></div><a href="#" class="button1 is-fifth w-inline-block"><div>Read Customer Story</div><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678141cce3153cc1bfc4e887_Arrow%20Right%20Up.webp" alt="" class="icon-1x1-medium"/></a></div><div id="w-node-_10a8b4c2-bcfb-d765-9d5e-92a59b9cc541-baefee19" class="tab_content-right"><img sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678142b8adaf283996ad2a47_2b10dd0c25b088e96514fe30ea7ce83c-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678142b8adaf283996ad2a47_2b10dd0c25b088e96514fe30ea7ce83c-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678142b8adaf283996ad2a47_2b10dd0c25b088e96514fe30ea7ce83c-p-1080.webp 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678142b8adaf283996ad2a47_2b10dd0c25b088e96514fe30ea7ce83c.webp 1801w" alt="A computer screen with a bunch of data on it." src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678142b8adaf283996ad2a47_2b10dd0c25b088e96514fe30ea7ce83c.webp" loading="lazy" class="tab_content-img"/><div class="tab_content-overlay"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6780dc377ec2780fa31a7e96_6615342b19e8aa7b8087d2c2_Deloitte.webp" alt="Deloitte logo" class="tab_content_overlay-img"/></div></div></div></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 3" class="w-tab-pane"><div class="tab_content"><div class="tab_content-left"><div class="tab_content-left-top"><div class="tab_content-title">Plivo Detects and Blocks Evolving Threats with AppSecure. 3</div><p class="tab_content-paragraph">AppSecure is like our extended security team. The AppSecure team is very patient in pointing out the non-trivial security bugs in our systems.</p></div><a href="#" class="button1 is-fifth w-inline-block"><div>Read Customer Story</div><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678141cce3153cc1bfc4e887_Arrow%20Right%20Up.webp" alt="" class="icon-1x1-medium"/></a></div><div id="w-node-_793e8ef0-8448-3426-d5dd-6c4c3fd17566-baefee19" class="tab_content-right"><img sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678142b8adaf283996ad2a47_2b10dd0c25b088e96514fe30ea7ce83c-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678142b8adaf283996ad2a47_2b10dd0c25b088e96514fe30ea7ce83c-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678142b8adaf283996ad2a47_2b10dd0c25b088e96514fe30ea7ce83c-p-1080.webp 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678142b8adaf283996ad2a47_2b10dd0c25b088e96514fe30ea7ce83c.webp 1801w" alt="A computer screen with a bunch of data on it." src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678142b8adaf283996ad2a47_2b10dd0c25b088e96514fe30ea7ce83c.webp" loading="lazy" class="tab_content-img"/><div class="tab_content-overlay"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6780dc377ec2780fa31a7e96_6615342b19e8aa7b8087d2c2_Deloitte.webp" alt="Deloitte logo" class="tab_content_overlay-img"/></div></div></div></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 4" class="w-tab-pane"><div class="tab_content"><div class="tab_content-left"><div class="tab_content-left-top"><div class="tab_content-title">Plivo Detects and Blocks Evolving Threats with AppSecure. 4</div><p class="tab_content-paragraph">AppSecure is like our extended security team. The AppSecure team is very patient in pointing out the non-trivial security bugs in our systems.</p></div><a href="#" class="button1 is-fifth w-inline-block"><div>Read Customer Story</div><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678141cce3153cc1bfc4e887_Arrow%20Right%20Up.webp" alt="" class="icon-1x1-medium"/></a></div><div id="w-node-f7be51f1-b01f-61fd-70c1-aa9725da91f3-baefee19" class="tab_content-right"><img sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678142b8adaf283996ad2a47_2b10dd0c25b088e96514fe30ea7ce83c-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678142b8adaf283996ad2a47_2b10dd0c25b088e96514fe30ea7ce83c-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678142b8adaf283996ad2a47_2b10dd0c25b088e96514fe30ea7ce83c-p-1080.webp 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678142b8adaf283996ad2a47_2b10dd0c25b088e96514fe30ea7ce83c.webp 1801w" alt="A computer screen with a bunch of data on it." src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678142b8adaf283996ad2a47_2b10dd0c25b088e96514fe30ea7ce83c.webp" loading="lazy" class="tab_content-img"/><div class="tab_content-overlay"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6780dc377ec2780fa31a7e96_6615342b19e8aa7b8087d2c2_Deloitte.webp" alt="Deloitte logo" class="tab_content_overlay-img"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_testimonial"><div class="padding-global padding-section-large"><div class="container-large"><div class="tag_wrapper"><div class="tag_outer is-dark-mode"><div class="tag_inner is-dark-mode"><div>Testimonial</div></div></div></div><div class="spacer-small"></div><div class="h2_wrapper"><h2 class="heading-style-h2">People <span class="text-color-yellow">Love</span> What We Do</h2></div><div class="spacer-large"></div><div class="shadow_wrapper"><div class="testimonial_list-wrapper"><div class="testimonial_list is-styled hide-tablet"><div class="testimonial_item"><div class="testimonial_card"><div class="testimonial_card-top"><div class="testimonial_tag"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6784eeab96aac083a9af5bc7_image%20(9).webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="testimonial_tag-icon"/><div class="testimonial_tag-service">Service Used:</div><div class="testimonial_tag-service is-active"><strong>Penetration Testing</strong><br/></div></div><p class="testimonial_paragraph">The team at AppSecure not only finds security loopholes but also <strong>provides detailed action plans to fix the vulnerabilities</strong> found in the system.</p></div><div class="testimonial_client-wrapper"><div class="testimonial_client-info"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6792a31c3a1ad690a6b653d1_image%20(10).webp" loading="lazy" alt="Mukund" class="testimonial_client-img"/><div class="testimonial_client-details"><div class="testimonial_client-name">Mukund</div><div class="testimonial_client-designation">Director Platform @Atlan</div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6792a36c68d9f13c5782747d_image%20238%20(2).webp" loading="lazy" alt="Atlan logo" class="testimonial_client-logo"/></div></div></div><div class="testimonial_item"><div class="testimonial_card"><div class="testimonial_card-top"><div class="testimonial_tag"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6784eeab96aac083a9af5bc7_image%20(9).webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="testimonial_tag-icon"/><div class="testimonial_tag-service">Service Used:</div><div class="testimonial_tag-service is-active"><strong>Penetration Testing</strong><br/></div></div><p class="testimonial_paragraph">They <strong>pointed out a bunch of high and critical vulnerabilities</strong>, helping us meet our goals and making our applications and APIs more secure.</p></div><div class="testimonial_client-wrapper"><div class="testimonial_client-info"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6792a31b3c9b59feb4764188_image%20(12).webp" loading="lazy" alt="Souvik Dutta" class="testimonial_client-img"/><div class="testimonial_client-details"><div class="testimonial_client-name">Souvik Dutta</div><div class="testimonial_client-designation">CTO &amp; Country Head @Signeasy</div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6792a31bed90685d964bdd2e_Signeasy.webp" loading="lazy" alt="AppSecure client Signeasy" class="testimonial_client-logo"/></div></div></div></div><div class="testimonial_list hide-tablet"><div class="testimonial_item"><div class="testimonial_card"><div class="testimonial_card-top"><div class="testimonial_tag"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6784eeab96aac083a9af5bc7_image%20(9).webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="testimonial_tag-icon"/><div class="testimonial_tag-service">Service Used:</div><div class="testimonial_tag-service is-active"><strong>Penetration Testing</strong><br/></div></div><p class="testimonial_paragraph">They have been instrumental in making ClearTax more secure, and I will <strong>highly recommend them to any company that takes security seriously.</strong></p></div><div class="testimonial_client-wrapper"><div class="testimonial_client-info"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6792a447dba857a93d46a6c7_image%20(10).webp" loading="lazy" alt="Ankit Solanki" class="testimonial_client-img"/><div class="testimonial_client-details"><div class="testimonial_client-name">Ankit Solanki</div><div class="testimonial_client-designation">Co-Founder @Cleartax</div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6792a36c1aace34d97b2d5d8_Group%2033760%20(1).webp" loading="lazy" alt="Cleartax logo" class="testimonial_client-logo"/></div></div></div><div class="testimonial_item"><div class="testimonial_card"><div class="testimonial_card-top"><div class="testimonial_tag"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6784eeab96aac083a9af5bc7_image%20(9).webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="testimonial_tag-icon"/><div class="testimonial_tag-service">Service Used:</div><div class="testimonial_tag-service is-active"><strong>Penetration Testing</strong><br/></div></div><p class="testimonial_paragraph">We have been working with AppSecure for 1 Year now and <strong>the team has helped us to make sure that our security is never compromised.</strong></p></div><div class="testimonial_client-wrapper"><div class="testimonial_client-info"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6792a31b5174a51b297a52f4_image%20(13).webp" loading="lazy" alt="Hari" class="testimonial_client-img"/><div class="testimonial_client-details"><div class="testimonial_client-name">Hari</div><div class="testimonial_client-designation">Vice President Engineering @Near</div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6792a31e2d3367f3b1cbee08_Near.webp" loading="lazy" alt="A black and white logo with the word negor on it." class="testimonial_client-logo"/></div></div></div><div class="testimonial_item"><div class="testimonial_card"><div class="testimonial_card-top"><div class="testimonial_tag"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6784eeab96aac083a9af5bc7_image%20(9).webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="testimonial_tag-icon"/><div class="testimonial_tag-service">Service Used:</div><div class="testimonial_tag-service is-active"><strong>Product Security</strong><br/></div></div><p class="testimonial_paragraph">AppSecure is like our extended security team. <strong>The AppSecure team is very patient</strong> in pointing out the non-trivial security bugs in our systems.</p></div><div class="testimonial_client-wrapper"><div class="testimonial_client-info"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6792a31bd7385bcf6dc27dbf_image%20(15).webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="testimonial_client-img"/><div class="testimonial_client-details"><div class="testimonial_client-name">Srirang</div><div class="testimonial_client-designation">Director Of Technology @Slice</div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6792a31d361f7accad1bc6e4_Slice.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Slice logo" class="testimonial_client-logo"/></div></div></div></div><div class="testimonial_list is-styled hide-tablet"><div id="w-node-_39445254-7795-4e3d-0ec9-59d230de2e19-4d3255ba" class="testimonial_item"><div class="testimonial_card"><div class="testimonial_card-top"><div class="testimonial_tag"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6784eeab96aac083a9af5bc7_image%20(9).webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="testimonial_tag-icon"/><div class="testimonial_tag-service">Service Used:</div><div class="testimonial_tag-service is-active"><strong>Product Security</strong><br/></div></div><p class="testimonial_paragraph">I have been <strong>impressed with AppSecure team&#x27;s deep expertise on the OWASP</strong> areas, and the team does quite a thorough job on each of the engagements and provide detailed and timely reports.<br/></p></div><div class="testimonial_client-wrapper"><div class="testimonial_client-info"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6792a31a424c81e5eeae4858_image%20(11).webp" loading="lazy" alt="Daniel Wong" class="testimonial_client-img"/><div class="testimonial_client-details"><div class="testimonial_client-na