v><div class="testimonial_item"><div class="testimonial_card"><div class="testimonial_card-top"><div class="testimonial_tag"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6784eeab96aac083a9af5bc7_image%20(9).webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="testimonial_tag-icon"/><div class="testimonial_tag-service">Service Used:</div><div class="testimonial_tag-service is-active"><strong>Penetration Testing</strong><br/></div></div><p class="testimonial_paragraph">We have been working with AppSecure for 1 Year now and <strong>the team has helped us to make sure that our security is never compromised.</strong></p></div><div class="testimonial_client-wrapper"><div class="testimonial_client-info"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6792a31b5174a51b297a52f4_image%20(13).webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="testimonial_client-img"/><div class="testimonial_client-details"><div class="testimonial_client-name">Hari</div><div class="testimonial_client-designation">Vice President Engineering @Near</div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6792a31e2d3367f3b1cbee08_Near.webp" loading="lazy" alt="A black and white logo with the word negor on it." class="testimonial_client-logo"/></div></div></div><div class="testimonial_item"><div class="testimonial_card"><div class="testimonial_card-top"><div class="testimonial_tag"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6784eeab96aac083a9af5bc7_image%20(9).webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="testimonial_tag-icon"/><div class="testimonial_tag-service">Service Used:</div><div class="testimonial_tag-service is-active"><strong>Penetration Testing</strong><br/></div></div><p class="testimonial_paragraph">They gave <strong>great feedback that improved the security of our products immensely</strong> and allowed us to focus on product development.<br/></p></div><div class="testimonial_client-wrapper"><div class="testimonial_client-info"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6792a31b39408ef3c430e093_image%20(14).webp" loading="lazy" alt="" class="testimonial_client-img"/><div class="testimonial_client-details"><div class="testimonial_client-name">Keith Morris</div><div class="testimonial_client-designation">Managing Director @Tanooki Labs</div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/6792a36c65f7161931b7a1c8_Group%2033761%20(1).webp" loading="lazy" alt="Tankooki labs logo" class="testimonial_client-logo"/></div></div></div></div><div class="testimonial_shadow"></div></div><div class="button-wrapper is-align-center"><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><a data-w-id="c221e97f-dd1c-51d3-95c2-a529e8d7228d" href="#" class="button1 is-first w-inline-block"><div>See all Testimonials</div><div class="icon-custom w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"/></svg></div></a></div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-wf--section-featured-case-studies-3--variant="normal" class="section_featured-blogs1 homepage"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="position-relative"><div class="padding-global padding-section-large no-slider"><div class="tag_wrapper"><div class="tag_outer"><div class="tag_inner"><div>Case Study</div></div></div></div><div class="spacer-small"></div><div class="container-large"><div class="splide sliderfeatured"><h2 class="heading-style-h2 text-color-dark-blue">Featured <span class="text-color-blue">Case Study</span></h2><div class="spacer-small"></div><div class="slide-in-bottom"><div class="code-embed-3 w-embed w-script"><script>
document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function () {

  const tabs = document.querySelectorAll(".case-study-tab");
  const cases = document.querySelectorAll(".case-study-feature-item");
  const wrapper = document.querySelector(".case-study-wrapper");

  let currentIndex = 0;
  let interval;

  function resetProgressBars(){
    tabs.forEach(tab => {
      const bar = tab.querySelector(".case-study-tab-status");
      if(bar){
        bar.style.transition = "none";
        bar.style.width = "0%";
      }
    });
  }

  function startProgress(tab){
    const bar = tab.querySelector(".case-study-tab-status");
    if(bar){
      setTimeout(() => {
        bar.style.transition = "width 10s linear";
        bar.style.width = "100%";
      }, 50);
    }
  }

  function showCase(index){

    // Hide all case studies
    cases.forEach(item => item.style.display = "none");

    // Show selected case study
    cases[index].style.display = "block";

    // Reset progress bars
    resetProgressBars();
    startProgress(tabs[index]);

    currentIndex = index;
  }

  function nextCase(){
    let nextIndex = currentIndex + 1;
    if(nextIndex >= cases.length){
      nextIndex = 0;
    }
    showCase(nextIndex);
  }

  function startAutoRotation(){
    interval = setInterval(nextCase, 10000);
  }

  function stopAutoRotation(){
    clearInterval(interval);
  }

  function resetAutoRotation(){
    stopAutoRotation();
    startAutoRotation();
  }

  // Initial state
  showCase(0);
  startAutoRotation();

  // Manual tab click
  tabs.forEach((tab,index)=>{
    tab.addEventListener("click",function(){
      showCase(index);
      resetAutoRotation();
    });
  });

  // Hover pause
  if(wrapper){
    wrapper.addEventListener("mouseenter",stopAutoRotation);
    wrapper.addEventListener("mouseleave",startAutoRotation);
  }

});
</script></div><div><div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="case-study-tabs-list w-dyn-items"><div data-case="loginradius" role="listitem" class="case-study-tab w-dyn-item"><div class="case-study-tab-content"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/678152e85743ff60dc810613/699d5b9fc4dba04b858a35cd_Announcing-New-Look-of-LoginRadius%201.avif" loading="lazy" alt="LoginRadius AppSecure" class="image-12"/></div><div class="case-study-tab-status"></div></div><div data-case="healthkart" role="listitem" class="case-study-tab w-dyn-item"><div class="case-study-tab-content"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/678152e85743ff60dc810613/698ad9c12d33b77b3d3058b2_HealthKart.avif" loading="lazy" alt="Healthkart Appsecure" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/678152e85743ff60dc810613/698ad9c12d33b77b3d3058b2_HealthKart-p-500.avif 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/678152e85743ff60dc810613/698ad9c12d33b77b3d3058b2_HealthKart.avif 1573w" class="image-12"/></div><div class="case-study-tab-status"></div></div><div data-case="zolve" role="listitem" class="case-study-tab w-dyn-item"><div class="case-study-tab-content"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/678152e85743ff60dc810613/695471ec750bd28f0a81c02e_zolve_logo.svg" loading="lazy" alt="Zolve AppSecure" class="image-12"/></div><div class="case-study-tab-status"></div></div><div data-case="matillion" role="listitem" class="case-study-tab w-dyn-item"><div class="case-study-tab-content"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/678152e85743ff60dc810613/68c7ba52afa82f97b0cf6a5e_Green-Horizontal-Logo-Matillion_.png" loading="lazy" alt="Matillion AppSecure" class="image-12"/></div><div class="case-study-tab-status"></div></div></div></div><div class="spacer-medium"></div><div fs-list-filteringclass="is-list-filtering" class="case-study-featured-wrapper w-dyn-list"><div fs-list-element="list" role="list" class="case-study-feature-list w-dyn-items"><div data-case-content="loginradius" role="listitem" class="case-study-feature-item w-dyn-item"><a href="/case-study/loginradius" class="case-study-feature-link w-inline-block"><div class="case-study_card-top"><div class="case-study_img-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/678152e85743ff60dc810613/699c344df18e15dd2bf8ebd0_Announcing-New-Look-of-LoginRadius.avif" loading="lazy" alt="LoginRadius AppSecure" class="case-study_img"/></div></div><div class="case-study_card-middle"><div fs-cmsfilter-field="*" class="case-study_title">LoginRadius Strengthened CIAM Platform Security Through Offensive Penetration Testing</div><div class="spacer-xsmall"></div><div class="case-study_stats-wrapper"><div class="case-study_stats"><div class="text-weight-medium text-color-dark-gray text-xs">Company size</div><div class="text-weight-semibold text-color-dark-blue text-xs">51-200</div></div><div class="case-study_stats"><div class="text-weight-medium text-color-dark-gray text-xs">Headquarter</div><div class="text-weight-semibold text-color-dark-blue text-xs">Vancouver, Canada</div></div></div><div class="spacer-xsmall"></div><div class="case-study_stats-wrapper cc-hide"><div class="case-study_stats"><div class="text-weight-semibold text-color-dark-blue">3X</div><div class="text-weight-medium text-color-dark-gray">Conversion Rate</div></div><div class="case-study_stats"><div class="text-weight-semibold text-color-dark-blue">5X</div><div class="text-weight-medium text-color-dark-gray">Lifetime Revenue</div></div></div><div fs-cmsfilter-field="tags-2" class="hide">All</div><p class="blog_author-card-paragraph">LoginRadius strengthened its CIAM platform security through black-box offensive penetration testing, resolving 100% of critical risks within 2 weeks.</p><div class="spacer-xsmall"></div><div class="button1 is-text"><div>Read Full Story</div><div class="icon-1x1-medium w-embed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" 