ine-block w-tab-link"><img sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678e6d19e2f8722ce43eaefd_image%20282%20(2)-p-500.png 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678e6d19e2f8722ce43eaefd_image%20282%20(2).webp 912w" alt="The economic times logo" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678e6d19e2f8722ce43eaefd_image%20282%20(2).webp" loading="lazy" class="news_logo-img"/><div class="news_timer"></div><div class="news_timer is-active"></div></a><a data-w-tab="Tab 3" class="news_item-tablet w-inline-block w-tab-link"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678b9548a9998141be929e6f_image%20279.webp" alt="ciso.in logo" class="news_logo-img"/><div class="news_timer"></div><div class="news_timer is-active"></div></a><a data-w-tab="Tab 4" class="news_item-tablet w-inline-block w-tab-link w--current"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678b954826ec52b2b778cae2_image%20280.webp" alt="Data quest logo" class="news_logo-img"/><div class="news_timer"></div><div class="news_timer is-active"></div></a></div><div class="news_content-wrapper w-tab-content"><div data-w-tab="Tab 1" class="w-tab-pane"><a href="https://techcrunch.com/2022/07/04/wework-exposed-visitors-data/" target="_blank" class="news_card w-inline-block"><div class="news_card-left"><div class="news_card-top"><div class="news_card-title">WeWork India exposed visitors’ personal information and selfies</div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><p class="news_card-paragraph">WeWork India has fixed a security lapse that exposed the personal information and selfies of tens of thousands of people who visited WeWork India’s coworking spaces.</p><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="news_card-text">Read More</div></div><div class="news_author-details-wrapper"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678e6b0a0445c5c4c1645cbe_techcrunch_icon.png.webp" alt="techcrunch icon" class="news_author-img"/><div class="news_author-details"><div class="news_author-name">TechCrunch</div><div class="news_date">Jul 4, 2022</div></div></div></div><div id="w-node-_73d4a741-213a-4643-7160-9cd54f6c8da2-b03eb70d" class="news_card-right"><img sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678e6aa46588dd08a96212a2_image%20(16)-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678e6aa46588dd08a96212a2_image%20(16).webp 594w" alt="A woman sitting at a desk in front of a computer." src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678e6aa46588dd08a96212a2_image%20(16).webp" loading="lazy" class="news_card-img"/></div></a></div><div data-w-tab="Tab 2" class="w-tab-pane"><a href="https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/tech/technology/wework-india-fixes-bug-that-exposed-visitors-personal-information/articleshow/92667872.cms?from=mdr" target="_blank" class="news_card w-inline-block"><div class="news_card-left"><div class="news_card-top"><div class="news_card-title">WeWork India fixes bug that exposed visitors&#x27; personal information</div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><p class="news_card-paragraph">Flexible workspace provider WeWork reportedly exposed the personal information and selfies of thousands of people who visited its co-working facilities in the country, a cyber-security research has claimed.</p><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="news_card-text">Read More</div></div><div class="news_author-details-wrapper"><img loading="lazy" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678b8e13bd9941498b7dcc66_Ellipse%203%20(1).webp" alt="A red circle with the letters e t on it." class="news_author-img"/><div class="news_author-details"><div class="news_author-name">The Economic Times</div><div class="news_date">Jul 5, 2022</div></div></div></div><div id="w-node-_73d4a741-213a-4643-716