nd selfies of thousands of people who visited its co-working facilities in the country, a cyber-security research has claimed.</p><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="news_card-text">Read More</div></div><div class="news_author-details-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678b8e13bd9941498b7dcc66_Ellipse%203%20(1).webp" loading="lazy" alt="A red circle with the letters e t on it." class="news_author-img"/><div class="news_author-details"><div class="news_author-name">The Economic Times</div><div class="news_date">Jul 5, 2022</div></div></div></div><div class="news_card-right"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678e6aa5b0e2307abe319218_Frame%201319.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678e6aa5b0e2307abe319218_Frame%201319-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678e6aa5b0e2307abe319218_Frame%201319-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678e6aa5b0e2307abe319218_Frame%201319.webp 891w" alt="A blurry photo of a restaurant with the word wework on it." class="news_card-img"/></div></a><a href="https://m.economictimes.com/tech/technology/hey-google-whos-calling/amp_articleshow/110627311.cms" target="_blank" class="news_card w-inline-block"><div class="news_card-left"><div class="news_card-top"><div class="news_card-title">Google tests new AI scam call detection feature amid rising cyber crime</div><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><p class="news_card-paragraph">Google is testing a new AI-based scam call detection feature. However, its legality is in question, as profiling callers based on conversation content without ....</p><div class="spacer-xxsmall"></div><div class="news_card-text">Read More</div></div><div class="news_author-details-wrapper"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/677e5264542a5dc0baefed6a/678b8e13bd9941498b7dcc66_Ellipse%2